# Two scenes only

- **MenuScene** — menu, tutorial slideshow, launching play.
- **GameScene** — all gameplay (skirmish and every tutorial map).

Do not add per-tutorial Unity scenes. Select maps via `MatchSettings.ApplyTutorialMatch(scenarioId)` (metadata in `tutorial_curriculum_manifest.json`) and `.gsdat` files. Next lesson reloads map data in the same Game scene.
